**Implemented**
- `scripts/lib/trace-to-eval-sample.mjs` — explicit-trigger converter with `traceToEvalSample(trace)` and `traceToEvalSamples(traces)`. A `failure` trace yields `expected = {before-fix: fail, after-fix: pass}`; `success|refusal|cancelled` stay `pass`. Samples carry a bounded `reproducer` (`scenario|route|command-id`, never shell), a `selector` (`runId`+`attempt`), and a deterministic 16-hex `digest`. A redaction gate refuses the whole trace (`trace-not-redacted`) on raw `prompt/messages/body/authorization/apiKey/headers` or `sk-/phc_/ghp_/AKIA/private-key`; the batch records per-trace rejections. Pure function, no scheduler/daemon.
